## Slide 20

Event Script Events 

The following transitions are monitored by the Logic Service for Event records…
On Start
On End
On OEE Type Changed
TrakSYS allows for these transitions to be used to trigger real-time functionality such as…
Email Notifications
Entity Script Class Events

